  "notes": "# Preview provenance\n\nThe stills and animated preview are taken from the saved native-resolution final-deck recording and its verified held frames, exported on 2026-10-13. The source recording is 2400 × 1350 at 60 fps. No new browser recording was performed for this gallery.\n\n`F1-Economics-Highlights.mp4` is a silent 40-second edit at 1920 × 1080 / 60 fps. Its source ranges are 16.2–32.0, 69.2–79.6, 111.0–118.8 and 224.0–230.0 seconds. The inline GIF is 18.0–32.0 seconds, reduced to 640 × 360 / 8 fps for README loading. These visual excerpts do not demonstrate the current procedural engine-audio revision.\n\nOnly resizing, JPEG/GIF encoding and video cuts were applied; no scene content was generated. Existing project attribution continues to apply. File hashes are in `manifest.json`.\n"
